# Appendable class infrastructure: AppendableSeq instance with string elements.
# Verifies that concat on Seq of strings works correctly.
# Uses map over range to create string Seqs without builtin-variant (not in type env).
[result: [collect [concat [map [fn [let _] "a"] [range 0 1]] [map [fn [let _] "b"] [range 0 1]]]]]
